        }
      ],
      "content": "in error for rafter, one of the beams which give slope and form to a roof (OED s.v. rafter n.^1) as raster is attested only in compounds raster cloth (barber’s towel) raster house (barber’s shop) (OED s.v. raster n.^1). Note that the Cologne translation describes this product as a beam or spar for a house (balken oder haussparren)"
    }
